Package: libpoppler140
Version: @DEB_POPPLER_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://poppler.freedesktop.org/
Depends: libfreetype6, libfontconfig1, libjpeg62-turbo, libpng16-16
Description: PDF rendering library - core runtime
 Poppler is a PDF rendering library based on the xpdf-3.0 code base. This package
 contains the core C++ shared library (libpoppler). Built minimal for the Xios
 desktop: glib frontend only, no qt/cpp frontends, JPEG via libjpeg-turbo, and
 nss/gpgme/lcms/openjpeg/tiff/curl support all disabled to avoid new dependencies.
